from mkchar import write
write("Gabriel_Remore","Gabriel Remore","1","1","13","Books 1, 2, 10 (chapter files)","Rufus_Remore.md, Arabelle_Remore.md, Roland_Remore.md",
 "Rufus's father, a strong adventurer who is among the first to answer when Jason's team is in trouble.",
 "- First seen as a lifelike water-link image of \"Rufus's father, Gabriel Remore\" (Book 1, Ch49 L27).\n- Appears in person at Farrah's wake with Rufus and Arabelle; Rufus's mother has even darker skin than her husband (Book 2, Ch32 L52).\n- Helps rescue a gold-rank messenger at the death-chamber gate in Cardinas with Arabelle (Book 10, Ch78 L52-89).\n- His request leads Danielle Geller to investigate Jason (notes, Book 1).",
 "Brisk and capable; he trusts his son's friends once they have earned it.")
write("Arabelle_Remore","Arabelle Remore","1","2","13","Books 2, 8, 9, 10 (chapter files)","Rufus_Remore.md, Gabriel_Remore.md",
 "Rufus's mother, a priestess of the Healer who specialises in mental health and trauma recovery.",
 "- With long hair dyed rainbow colours \"in the Vitesse style\" (Book 2, Ch32 L52).\n- A member of the Church of the Healer specialising in mental health and trauma recovery, who has worked extensively with Jason (Book 8, Ch2 L49).\n- Examines Jason's body-matrix and soul with Carlos in Book 8 (Book 8, Ch47 L31).\n- Is with Gabriel at the death-chamber gate in Cardinas (Book 10, Ch78 L52).",
 "Warm, direct and professionally unshockable.")
write("Roland_Remore","Roland Remore","0","3","13","Books 1, 3, 12 (chapter files)","Rufus_Remore.md, Gabriel_Remore.md, ../06_Places/Vitesse.md",
 "Rufus's grandfather, a diamond-rank sword master and the archchancellor of Remore Academy in Vitesse.",
 "- \"The famous, diamond-rank sword master, Roland Remore\"; Rufus often repeats advice from him (Book 3, Ch20 L25).\n- Rarely seen on the Remore Academy campus, \"the presence of the diamond-rank arch-chancellor was always felt\" (Book 3, Ch69 L587).\n- \"Looked like a well-preserved forty, a tenth of the reality\": tall, strong and handsome, with a round bush of dark curly hair (Book 3, Ch69 L588).\n- Humphrey calls him \"the grandfather who means so much to his friend\" (Book 12, Ch45 L97).\n- Burning Violet became more associated with the Academy after he became guild leader (Book 6, Ch47 L125).",
 "Measured, aphoristic and rarely seen; scenes with him should feel weighty.")
write("Gwydion_Remore","Gwydion Remore","2","11","13","Books 11 (chapter files)","Rufus_Remore.md, Gary.md, ../02_Cosmology_and_Powers/Gods_and_Churches.md",
 "Rufus's older brother, a priest of Hero.",
 "- A priest of Hero with skin of dark chocolate and \"a thornbush of curly hair\" who sits with Danielle Geller at the bottom of the Yaresh shaft (Book 11, Ch60 L13).\n- Rufus's older brother (Book 11, Ch67 L20).\n- Worries about his family underground during the Cardinas expedition (Book 11, Ch60 L22).\n- Tells Gary that Hero has decided to sanction himself (Book 11, Ch68 L707-709).",
 "Easygoing, card-playing and quietly devout; the family's softer edge.")
write("Keith_Geller","Keith Geller","0","1","13","Books 2, 12 (chapter files)","Danielle_Geller.md, Humphrey_Geller.md, Henrietta_Geller.md",
 "Humphrey's father, a solid and reliable counterpoint to Danielle.",
 "- \"Compared to Danielle, her husband, Keith, was more akin to their son: a solid and reliable counterpoint to her domineering charms\" (Book 2, Ch62 L24).\n- Greets Jason at the Book 12 reunion with Danielle (notes, Book 12 Ch15).",
 "Quiet and dependable; defers to Danielle in public.")
write("Henrietta_Geller","Henrietta Geller","0","2","13","Book 2 (chapter files)","Humphrey_Geller.md, Danielle_Geller.md, Keith_Geller.md",
 "Humphrey's older sister, a stoic summoner.",
 "- Takes \"her role of Humphrey's older sister seriously\" and makes it clear that his teammates are yet to meet her approval (Book 2, Ch62 L24).\n- Directs the response to the Old City elemental manifestation (notes, Book 3).",
 "Stern, protective and hard to impress.")
write("Rick_Geller","Rick Geller","0","1","13","Books 1, 3, 9 (chapter files)","Phoebe_Geller.md, Humphrey_Geller.md",
 "A Geller adventurer who demands a rematch with Jason's team and leads his own team of Gellers and elves.",
 "- Dark-brown skin and light-brown hair, with a build like Humphrey's, \"tall and broad-shouldered\"; he leads four others (Book 1, Ch66 L58-62).\n- His demand for a rematch is \"the drive to improve himself that was common to the Geller clan\" (Book 1, Ch66 L62).\n- Three of his team of five are Gellers; the other two are twin elf sisters (Book 1, Ch66 L62; Book 9, Ch104 L54).\n- The notes make him Hannah's husband (notes, Book 12).",
 "Driven but not proud; a good-natured rival.")
write("Phoebe_Geller","Phoebe Geller","0","1","13","Books 1, 2, 9 (chapter files)","Rick_Geller.md, Humphrey_Geller.md",
 "A distant Geller cousin who is Humphrey's contemporary and later Rick's teammate.",
 "- A distant cousin of Humphrey, iron rank and with the Adventure Society for more than half a year, with darker skin and much lighter hair than his (Book 1, Ch66 L3-4).\n- Is Rick's sister and back on his team by Book 9 (Book 9, Ch104 L54).",
 "Blunt and curious; she asks what everyone is thinking.")
